AGE}/46029398/49901fdb3f848682328915833fc56ba94b51ade6.png This new bonus map invites you to explore an unfamiliar liminal space, where the rooms feel almost ordinary and the whole place feels slightly wrong. There’s nothing to win here. Take a look","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:41:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4417060-1838407329260563","game_id":"steam-4417060","kind":"update","title":"Demo Balancing Update","summary":"After analysing gameplay data from the first 24 hours after release, the following changes were made: The large level with a wide-open space and an arch in the middle has been replaced with an entirely different level, one that provides a similar challenge but is smaller and better suited to speedrunning and chasing leaderboard clout. The removed level will still be available in the full version of the game. The level with the fire tower has been altered - the homing fireball is now slightly slo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T19:40:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329260563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4417060-1838407329256962","game_id":"steam-4417060","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Now Available!","summary":"The free demo of Dark Roll 2 is out now!Test your skills across seven handcrafted levels, dodge deadly traps, collect gems, race player ghosts, climb the leaderboards, unlock orb skins that carry over to the full game!Face Igor the Overseer in a climactic boss fight!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T15:02:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"htt